(7687729, 1259287, 30861, '<td valign="top">I am a house, says Senlin, locked and darkened,<br/>Sealed from the sun with wall and door and blind.<br/>Summon me loudly, and you''ll hear slow footsteps<br/>Ring far and faint in the galleries of my mind.<br/>You''ll hear soft steps on an old and dusty stairway;<br/>Peer darkly through some corner of a pane,<br/>You''ll see me with a faint light coming slowly,<br/>Pausing above some gallery of the brain . . .<br/> <br/><i>-- Conrad Aiken</i></td>', 'I am a house, says Senlin, locked and darkened,Sealed from the sun with wall and door and blind.Summon me loudly, and you''ll hear slow footstepsRing far and faint in the galleries of my mind.You''ll hear soft steps on an old and dusty stairway;Peer darkly through some corner of a pane,You''ll see me with a faint light coming slowly,Pausing above some gallery of the brain . . . -- Conrad Aiken', '2021-02-22 00:16:28.000000', NULL, 1),
