(7687744, 1259270, 4008, '<td valign="top">Just perfect. Love the shapes, textures, composition. The light brings out all details perfectly. <br/>Used a thin strip light? I have a hard time figuring out what light setup you used. The middle one seems to be lit from above but the other ones seems to be lit from the high-left. <br/>A composition of multiple images? I think around the stem I can see those are cut-outs but the rest is done perfectly.<br/>In my top 3.</td>', 'Just perfect. Love the shapes, textures, composition. The light brings out all details perfectly. Used a thin strip light? I have a hard time figuring out what light setup you used. The middle one seems to be lit from above but the other ones seems to be lit from the high-left. A composition of multiple images? I think around the stem I can see those are cut-outs but the rest is done perfectly.In my top 3.', '2021-02-22 04:25:27.000000', NULL, 1),
