(7688227, 1259276, 4008, '<td valign="top">Simply beautiful. The eyes (!!), the face, the hair, the look, the flower, it all creates a very attractive image and atmosphere. Good use of a hair light as well, very subtle but effective. A minor point : In post processing I would try to put a graduated filter on it to warm up the lower part of the image so the colour of her arms is closer to the warm colour of her face. top 10</td>', 'Simply beautiful. The eyes (!!), the face, the hair, the look, the flower, it all creates a very attractive image and atmosphere. Good use of a hair light as well, very subtle but effective. A minor point : In post processing I would try to put a graduated filter on it to warm up the lower part of the image so the colour of her arms is closer to the warm colour of her face. top 10', '2021-02-28 11:51:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(7688228, 1259268, 4008, '<td valign="top">A real bad quality of the base images used in this composition. Also the edges stand out and give this a real copy and paste look.</td>', 'A real bad quality of the base images used in this composition. Also the edges stand out and give this a real copy and paste look.', '2021-02-28 11:54:05.000000', NULL, 1),
