(7688885, 1259288, 30049, '<td valign="top">Not sure what exactly grabs me about this image.  Something.  The bold diagonal of the building is a place to start I think.  It''s like, here I am - this strong, dominant building - those ominous skies can''t intimidate me!  Besides, I have my own power source buddy right outside my front door.  :-)  The sky is pretty darn awesome too.  Well done!</td>', 'Not sure what exactly grabs me about this image.  Something.  The bold diagonal of the building is a place to start I think.  It''s like, here I am - this strong, dominant building - those ominous skies can''t intimidate me!  Besides, I have my own power source buddy right outside my front door.  :-)  The sky is pretty darn awesome too.  Well done!', '2021-03-07 21:34:46.000000', NULL, 0),
